#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:385
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Hoʻohana ʻia ka Code Country Default no ka hoʻopili ʻana i nā helu ʻaʻole i "
"hoʻokomo i kahi prefix honua (e laʻa, +358).\n"
"\n"
"Inā waiho ʻole ʻia, e hoʻāʻo ka ʻōnaehana e ʻike maʻalahi iā ia mai kāu "
"kāleka SIM a i ʻole pūnaewele.\n"
"\n"
"Hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻopau lima iā ia ma ʻaneʻi ma ke hoʻokomo ʻana i kahi code "
"ʻāpana ISO 2-hua (e laʻa, US, FI, DE) a i ʻole he code kelepona (e laʻa."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:413
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic uses the limit reported by the phone's MMS service, which is right "
"for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your messages fail to send, or a "
"larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Kaupalena nā ʻoihana kelepona i ka nui o ka memo multimedia. Hoʻoemi ʻia nā "
"kiʻi a me nā wikiō āu e hoʻopili ai ma ke ʻano ʻaunoa i lalo o kēia palena "
"ma mua o ka hoʻouna ʻana.\n"
"\n"
"Hoʻohana ʻo ʻAunoa i ka palena i hōʻike ʻia e ka lawelawe MMS o ke kelepona, "
"kūpono ia no ka hapa nui o nā ʻoihana. E koho i kahi waiwai liʻiliʻi inā "
"ʻaʻole hiki ke hoʻouna ʻia kāu mau memo, a i ʻole kahi mea nui aʻe inā ʻike "
"ʻoe ua ʻae kāu ʻoihana."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:435
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"ʻO ke kani kani ka leo i hoʻokani ʻia (toot-toot-toot) oiai e kali ana no ka "
"pane ʻana i waho. ʻAʻole hoʻopuka kekahi mau mea lawe ia no laila ua loaʻa "
"iā mākou ke koho e hana lima ia ma aneʻi. \n"
"\n"
"Hiki iā ʻoe ke koho i kāu faila mele ponoʻī, a i ʻole e hoʻomaʻemaʻe iā ia e "
"hoʻohana i ka leo ʻōnaehana maʻamau."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "E koho i ka Ringback Tone"

