msgstr "Nā waihona leo"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:489
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"E koho i nā puke helu wahi e hoʻohana ai me Telephony a hoʻonohonoho iā "
"lākou e like me ka mea nui. ʻO ka puke helu helu kiʻekiʻe ka mea nui loa a "
"makemake ʻia inā loaʻa kekahi helu ma nā puke helu he nui. Hiki iā ʻoe ke "
"hoʻohana i ka Duplicate Resolver toggle ma lalo nei e kōkua i ka hoʻokele "
"ʻana i nā kope, akā inā ʻaʻole paʻa, paipai mākou e ʻae iā ia no kahi ʻike "
"maikaʻi aʻe."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:508
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Ke hoʻohana ʻia, inā e kāhea ka helu kelepona iā ʻoe i 3 mau manawa i loko o "
"5 mau minuke, ʻo ke kolu o ke kelepona (a me nā mea aʻe i loko o ka puka "
"aniani) e koi i ke kelepona e kani i ka leo kiʻekiʻe loa, e kāpae ana i nā "
"mode Silent or Do Not Disturb."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:520
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"E koho i nā hoapili e pāʻani mau i nā leka hoʻomaopopo i ka leo piha, ʻoiai "
"ke kelepona ʻana i ke ʻano Silent a i ʻole Do Disturb mode."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:541
msgid "Unknown Callers"
msgstr "Nā mea kelepona ʻike ʻole"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:546
msgid "Unknown Callers Action"
msgstr "Hana ʻAʻole ʻike ʻia nā mea kelepona"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:548
msgid "Applies also to hidden numbers."
msgstr "Pili no hoi i na helu huna."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:551
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Mai hana i kekahi mea"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:552
msgid "Block Completely"
msgstr "Paʻa loa"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:553
msgid "Silence and Hide UI"
msgstr "Hamau a Hūnā UI"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:554
msgid "Silence Only"
msgstr "Hamau Wale"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:562
msgid "Add Search button to InCall window and Call History for unknown callers"
msgstr ""
"Hoʻohui i ke pihi Huli i ka puka makani InCall a me Call History no nā mea "
"kelepona ʻike ʻole"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:568
msgid "Search Engine"
msgstr "ʻEnekini Huli"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:572
#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:577
msgid "Custom URL"
msgstr "HKH maʻamau"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:627
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the URL you want to use for searching unknown numbers. Include "
"'{number}' in the URL where the caller's phone number should go.\n"
"\n"
"For example: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"When you tap the search button during a call, we will replace '{number}' "
"with the actual phone number and open it in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"E hoʻokomo i ka URL āu e makemake ai e hoʻohana no ka ʻimi ʻana i nā helu "
"ʻike ʻole. E hoʻokomo i ka '{number}' ma ka URL kahi e hele ai ka helu "
"kelepona o ka mea kelepona.\n"
"\n"
"No ka laʻana: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"Ke paʻi ʻoe i ke pihi huli i ke kelepona ʻana, e hoʻololi mākou iā "
"'{number}' me ka helu kelepona maoli a wehe ʻia i kāu polokalamu kele "
"pūnaewele."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:631
msgid "Custom Search URL"
msgstr "HKH Huli Kūʻai"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:652
msgid "Desktop Shortcuts"
msgstr "Nā Pōkole Desktop"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:657
msgid "Calls"
msgstr "Kāhea ʻia"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:823
msgid "Name (e.g. Mom)"
msgstr "Ka inoa (e.g. Māmā)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"ʻO kēia ka leo o ke kelepona no kēlā me kēia puka. Hoʻopili ʻakomi ʻia ka "
"pae ke pili ke kelepona a i kēlā me kēia manawa e loli ai ka puka i ka wā "
"kelepona, a lohe koke ʻia nā loli o ka paheʻe. Hoʻopili ka lako i nā pae ma "
"nā ʻanuʻu nui, ʻaʻole loa e hāmau loa ka mea hoʻolohe pepeiao. Mālama ʻia ka "
"pae Bluetooth no ke kākoʻo alahele e hiki mai ana."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:889
msgid "Decline Message"
msgstr "Hoʻole i ka leka"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:925
msgid "System Default (Always Enabled)"
msgstr "Pūnaehana Default (Hā mau ʻia)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:927
msgid "Synced from Andromeda"
msgstr "Ua hoʻolikelike ʻia mai Andromeda"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:930
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Ua pili"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:931
msgid "Connecting..."
msgstr "Ke hoʻopili nei..."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:933
msgid "Login required"
msgstr "Pono ke komo ʻana"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:934
msgid "Connection failed (SSL)"
msgstr "ʻAʻole i pili (SSL)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:949
msgid "Address book name"
msgstr "Ka inoa o ka puke helu"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:970
msgid "Could not create address book"
msgstr "ʻAʻole hiki ke hana i ka puke helu"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:972
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Address book '{name}' created"
msgstr "Ua hana ʻia ka puke helu '{name}'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1061
msgid "Personal Address Book"
msgstr "Buke Haiolelo Pilikino"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1062
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced to Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"ʻO kēia ka puke helu wahi e hoʻopili ʻia iā Andromeda inā koho ʻoe e hana "
"pēlā ma nā Pūnaewele Pūnaewele."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1070
msgid "Andromeda Contacts"
msgstr "Nā Hoʻopili Andromeda"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1071
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced from Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"ʻO kēia ka puke helu wahi e hoʻonohonoho ʻia mai Andromeda inā koho ʻoe e "
"hana pēlā ma nā Pūnaewele Pūnaewele."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1211
msgid "Settings Saved"
msgstr "Mālama ʻia nā ʻōkuhi"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:62
msgid "Voice Message"
msgstr "Leo Leo"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:120
msgid "Tap to Record"
msgstr "Kaomi no ka hoʻopaʻa ʻana"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:177
msgid "Attach Voice Note"
msgstr "Hoʻopili i ka leka leo"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:308
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recording is too large for MMS (Max {size}). Please retake shorter."
msgstr ""
"Nui loa ka hoʻopaʻa ʻana no MMS (Max {size}). E ʻoluʻolu e hoʻopaʻa hou i "
"kahi pōkole."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:142
msgid "Enable Feature"
msgstr "Hoʻohana i ka hiʻohiʻona"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:171
msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts "
"below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"Hiki i nā pilina ke hoʻomaka i kahi hana ma ka hoʻouna ʻana i kahi leka SMS "
"huna. Hoʻohui i nā pilina ma lalo a hoʻonoho i kā lākou ʻōlelo huna."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:174
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their "
"secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Hiki i nā pilina hilinaʻi ke noi i kou wahi ma ka hoʻouna ʻana i kahi leka "
"SMS huna. He koʻikoʻi ka TOTP i mea e hana ai kēia hiʻohiʻona. Hoʻohui i nā "
"pilina ma lalo a hoʻonoho i kā lākou ʻōlelo huna. Laʻana anakuhi: 'SECRET "
"TOTP' Laʻana maoli: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:177
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Hiki i nā mea hoʻopili hilinaʻi ke hoʻomaka mālie i kahi kelepona ma ka "
"hoʻouna ʻana i kahi leka SMS huna. He koʻikoʻi ka TOTP i mea e hana ai kēia "
"hiʻohiʻona. Hoʻohui i nā pilina ma lalo a hoʻonoho i kā lākou ʻōlelo huna. "
"Laʻana anakuhi: 'SECRET TOTP' Laʻana maoli: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:180
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Hiki i nā pilina hilinaʻi ke hoʻouna i kahi leka SMS i hoʻokuʻu ʻia. He "
"koʻikoʻi ka TOTP i mea e hana ai kēia hiʻohiʻona. Hoʻohui i nā pilina ma "
"lalo a hoʻonoho i kā lākou ʻōlelo huna. Laʻana anakuhi: 'SECRET TOTP "
"+1234567890 MESSAGE' Laʻana maoli: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Hello'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:183
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Hiki i nā pilina hilinaʻi ke hoʻomaka i kahi hālāwai SSH tmate a loaʻa i ke "
"kaula komo SSH ma ka hoʻouna ʻana i kahi leka SMS huna. He koʻikoʻi ka TOTP "
"i mea e hana ai kēia hiʻohiʻona. Hoʻohui i nā pilina ma lalo a hoʻonoho i kā "
"lākou ʻōlelo huna. Laʻana anakuhi: 'SECRET TOTP' Laʻana maoli: 'Gorilla "
"123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:186
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can wipe your device. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Hiki i nā pilina hilinaʻi ke holoi i kāu kelepona. He koʻikoʻi ka TOTP i mea "
"e hana ai kēia hiʻohiʻona. Hoʻohui i nā pilina ma lalo a hoʻonoho i kā lākou "
"ʻōlelo huna. Laʻana anakuhi: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN "
"SUDO_PASSWORD' Laʻana maoli: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 "
"SupportYourLocalFootball'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:303
msgid "View or edit TOTP"
msgstr "E nānā a hoʻoponopono paha i ka TOTP"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:305
msgid "Setup TOTP"
msgstr "Hoʻonohonoho i ka TOTP"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:380
msgid "Secret message"
msgstr "Memo huna"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:392
msgid "Remove Contact"
msgstr "Wehe i ka Hoʻokaʻaʻike"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:416
msgid "Contact removed (Click Save to commit)"
msgstr "Wehe ʻia ka hoʻokaʻaʻike (Komi i ka Save no ka hana ʻana)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:490
msgid "Contact already in trusted list"
msgstr "Hoʻokaʻaʻike ma ka papa inoa hilinaʻi"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:504
msgid "Contact added"
msgstr "Hoʻohui ʻia ka pilina"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:522
msgid "TOTP Setup"
msgstr "Hoʻonohonoho TOTP"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:568
msgid ""
"Share this code with your trusted contact. They should add it to an "
"authenticator app such as Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If entering manually, ensure the following settings:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"Each action has its own code. When triggering an action by SMS, they must "
"append the current 6-digit code from their authenticator after the keyword."
msgstr ""
"E kaʻana like i kēia code me kāu pilina hilinaʻi. Pono lākou e hoʻohui i "
"kahi polokalamu hōʻoia e like me Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"Inā hoʻokomo me ka lima, e hōʻoia i nā hoʻonohonoho penei:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"He code ko kēlā me kēia hana. Ke hoʻomaka ʻana i kahi hana e SMS, pono lākou "
"e hoʻopili i ke code 6-helu o kēia manawa mai kā lākou mea hōʻoia ma hope o "
"ka huaʻōlelo."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:597
msgid "Copy TOTP key"
msgstr "Kope i ke kī TOTP"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:608
#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:650
msgid "Regenerate"
msgstr "Hana hou"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:615
msgid "Remove current TOTP"
msgstr "Wehe i ka TOTP o kēia manawa"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:624
msgid "Remove TOTP Key?"
msgstr "Wehe i ke kī TOTP?"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:625
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the TOTP key? This action will disable TOTP "
"verification for this feature."
msgstr ""
"Makemake ʻoe e wehe i ke kī TOTP? E hoʻopau kēia hana i ka hōʻoia TOTP no "
"kēia hiʻohiʻona."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:645
msgid "Regenerate Code?"
msgstr "Hana hou i ke code?"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:646
msgid ""
"This will invalidate the current code in your contact's authenticator app. "
"Are you sure?"
msgstr ""
"E hoʻopau kēia i ke code o kēia manawa ma ka polokalamu hōʻoia o kāu pilina. "
"He ʻoiaʻiʻo kēnā?"

